ry.<\/p>\n    <p>Items must be unused and returned in original packaging.<\/p>\n    <p>Refunds are processed within 5–7 business days after inspection.<\/p>\n    <p>Custom-made and personalized products are not eligible for return.<\/p>\n    <p>Our support team is available to assist you with the return process.<\/p>\n  <\/div>\n<\/details>\n\n  <!-- Payment Methods -->\n  <details>\n    <summary>\n      <span class=\"feature-title\">Payment Methods<\/span>\n      <span class=\"arrow-icon\">\n        <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\">\n          <path d=\"M6 9L12 15L18 9\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\/>\n        <\/svg>\n      <\/span>\n    <\/summary>\n\n    <div class=\"feature-body\">\n      <p><strong>RuPay<\/strong> — Secure Indian debit & credit card payments.<\/p>\n      <p><strong>Cashfree Payments<\/strong> — Fast UPI, cards, and net banking checkout.<\/p>\n      <p><strong>PayPal<\/strong> — Global secure payment gateway.<\/p>\n      <p><strong>Mastercard<\/strong> — International credit & debit card support.<\/p>\n      <p>All payments are encrypted and 100% secure.<\/p>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/details>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<style>\n.feature-accordion {\n  margin-top: 24px;\n}\n\n.feature-accordion details {\n  border: 1px solid #e5e5e5;\n  border-radius: 14px;\n  background: #fff;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n}\n\n.feature-accordion summary {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n  padding: 18px 22px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  list-style: none;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: #111;\n}\n\n.feature-accordion summary::-webkit-details-marker {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n.arrow-icon {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  transition: transform 0.3s ease;\n}\n\n.feature-accordion details[open] .arrow-icon {\n  transform: rotate(180deg);\n}\n\n.feature-body {\n  padding: 18px 22px 22px;\n  color: #5